The  driver  provides support for a Small Computer Systems Inter‐
face bus and Advanced Technology Attachment Packet Interface Com‐
pact Disc‐Read Only Memory drive.  In an attempt to look  like  a
regular  disk, the driver synthesizes a partition table, with one
partition covering the entire It is possible to modify this  par‐
tition  table using but it will only last until the is unmounted.
