then  the act of changing the media will invalidate the disklabel
and information held within the kernel.  To stop corruption,  all
accesses  to the device will be discarded until there are no more
open file descriptors referencing the device.   During  this  pe‐
riod,  all new open attempts will be rejected.  When no more open
file descriptors reference the device, the first next  open  will
load a new set of parameters (including disklabel) for the drive.
